4543..4609 Comment "/// The loop\'s words and the presented integers are equivalent, by"
4610..4685 Comment "/// `windWords` and `spinWords` with the two round trips at a variable (the"
4686..4762 Comment "/// book\'s Theorem 8.1.9, one stratum down). The later entries read `to` and"
4763..4838 Comment "/// `back`, so the record is their dependent pairs nested to the right, and"
4839..4915 Comment "/// its value nests the same way: `sectWords` and `retrWords` are checked at"
4916..4986 Comment "/// the types the record states once `to` is `windWords` and `back` is"
4987..5003 Comment "/// `spinWords`."
